# This is an example of a configuration file for Imfit.
# More specifically, it specifies a Sersic model for use in fitting a 
# 256x256-pixel SDSS r-band cutout image of the galaxy IC 3478.

X0   190.0    175,225
Y0   150.0    140,170
FUNCTION Sersic
PA    18.0    0,90
ell    0.2    0,1
n      1.5    0,5
I_e    15     0,500
r_e    25     0,100

